{{define "content"}}
<h1>Runtime / 本地运行时</h1>

{{if .Saved}}
<div class="notice ok">已保存。新的本地密钥要重启进程后才会被代理入口启用。 / Saved. Restart required.</div>
{{end}}
{{if .RuntimeError}}
<div class="notice err">{{.RuntimeError}}</div>
{{end}}

<section class="card">
  <h2>本地客户端入口 / Local Endpoints</h2>
  <p class="muted">把下面两个地址配到你的 Codex CLI / Claude Code 客户端里。运行时配置写入磁盘后，当前进程仍按启动时的配置工作，直到下一次重启。</p>

  <div class="field">
    <span class="field-label">OpenAI Base URL <span class="en">for Codex CLI</span></span>
    <span class="field-hint">把客户端的 <code>OPENAI_BASE_URL</code> 设为此值，鉴权头使用 <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;本地密钥&gt;</code>。</span>
    <div class="field-inline">
      <input readonly data-copy-source id="openai-url" value="{{.OpenAIBaseURL}}">
      <button type="button" class="subtle" data-copy-target="openai-url">复制</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="field">
    <span class="field-label">Anthropic Base URL <span class="en">for Claude Code</span></span>
    <span class="field-hint">把客户端的 <code>ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL</code> 设为此值，鉴权头支持 <code>x-api-key</code> 或 <code>Authorization: Bearer</code>。</span>
    <div class="field-inline">
      <input readonly data-copy-source id="anthropic-url" value="{{.AnthropicURL}}">
      <button type="button" class="subtle" data-copy-target="anthropic-url">复制</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<form class="card" method="post" action="/admin/runtime">
  <h2>本地网关密钥 / Local API Key</h2>
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  <div class="field">
    <span class="field-label">本地密钥 <span class="en">Local API key</span></span>
    <span class="field-hint">客户端访问本地代理入口时必须携带此密钥；它和上游中转站的密钥无关。修改后需要重启进程。</span>
    <div class="field-inline">
      <input id="local-api-key" name="local_api_key" type="password" value="{{.LocalAPIKey}}" required autocomplete="new-password">
      <button type="button" class="subtle" data-toggle-password="local-api-key">显示</button>
      <button type="button" class="subtle" data-copy-target="local-api-key">复制</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">配置文件位置 / Runtime file: <code>{{.RuntimeFilePath}}</code></p>
  <p class="notice warn">修改后需要重启进程才会生效。 / Restart required after saving changes.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <button type="submit">Save Runtime</button>
  </div>
</form>
{{end}}
